.         test [m_father_mean]1.daughter = [m_mother_mean]1.daughter

 ( 1)  [m_father_mean]1.daughter - [m_mother_mean]1.daughter = 0

           chi2(  1) =    3.28
         Prob > chi2 =    0.0703

. 
.         
. * EXTRACT AND EXPORT RESULTS * 
. 
.         * Extract the required statistics
. 
.                 * (i) difference in coefficient estimate of daughters for fat
> hers and mothers
.                 local coefficient = _b[m_father_mean:1.daughter]-_b[m_mother_
> mean:1.daughter]

. 
.                 * (ii) Chi2 value
.                 local chi2=  r(chi2)

. 
.                 * ADDED
.                 * (ii) Standard error (from lincom)
.                 lincom [m_father_mean]1.daughter - [m_mother_mean]1.daughter

 ( 1)  [m_father_mean]1.daughter - [m_mother_mean]1.daughter = 0

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
             | Coefficient  Std. err.      z    P>|z|     [95% conf. interval]
-------------+----------------------------------------------------------------
         (1) |      -2.95   1.629753    -1.81   0.070    -6.144258     .244258
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

.                 local se = r(se)

.                 * ADDED END
. 
.                 * (iii) family of the test statistic (e.g. z, t, F, Chi²)
.                 local test_stat_family = "Chi²"

. 
.                 * (iv) residual and model degrees of freedom (DFs) if applica
> ble
.                 local df_residual = r(df)

. 
.                 * (v) p-value
.                 local p_value = r(p)

. 
.                 * (vi) number of observations
.                 local num_obs = e(N)

. 
.                 * (vii) number of participants
.                 quietly levelsof pid if e(sample), local(participants)

.                 local num_participants : word count `participants'

. 
.                 * (viii) interpretation of directionality
